    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ONE SHIP. ONE SURVIVOR. 30 DAYS TO LIVE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up alone. The engines are silent. The crew is gone. Around you \u2014 endless ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>30 Days Adrift</i>, a tense and atmospheric survival game set aboard a massive cargo ship owned by the Japanese company <strong>Shinyo Freight Lines</strong>. The vessel drifts somewhere in the Pacific Ocean. There\u2019s no map, no signal, no rescue coming \u2014 only the crashing waves, rusted steel, and hundreds of sealed containers whose contents could save you\u2026 or destroy you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE. BUILD. SURVIVE. YOU HAVE 30 DAYS.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock the Unknown</strong><br>Open randomized shipping containers. You might find food, tools, water, weapons \u2014 or something far more disturbing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge and Build</strong><br>Turn broken ship parts into shelter, tools, and survival systems. Reclaim the deck and make it your temporary home \u2014 or fortress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endure the Ocean</strong><br>Face scorching sun, brutal storms, pitch-black nights, and oppressive silence. Track your physical and mental health. Nature won\u2019t go easy on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep Your Sanity</strong><br>Isolation distorts reality. Are the things you see real \u2014 or is your mind unraveling?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Truth</strong><br>What happened to the crew? Why is the ship drifting? And what lies hidden deep below deck?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY CONTAINER IS A RISK.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters. Every second counts.<br>Will you survive \u2014 or become part of the mystery?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist <i>30 Days Adrift</i> and prove you can outlast the sea.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ONE SHIP. ONE SURVIVOR. 30 DAYS TO LIVE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up alone. The engines are silent. The crew is gone. Around you \u2014 endless ocean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>30 Days Adrift</i>, a tense and atmospheric survival game set aboard a massive cargo ship owned by the Japanese company <strong>Shinyo Freight Lines</strong>. The vessel drifts somewhere in the Pacific Ocean. There\u2019s no map, no signal, no rescue coming \u2014 only the crashing waves, rusted steel, and hundreds of sealed containers whose contents could save you\u2026 or destroy you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE. BUILD. SURVIVE. YOU HAVE 30 DAYS.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock the Unknown</strong><br>Open randomized shipping containers. You might find food, tools, water, weapons \u2014 or something far more disturbing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge and Build</strong><br>Turn broken ship parts into shelter, tools, and survival systems. Reclaim the deck and make it your temporary home \u2014 or fortress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endure the Ocean</strong><br>Face scorching sun, brutal storms, pitch-black nights, and oppressive silence. Track your physical and mental health. Nature won\u2019t go easy on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep Your Sanity</strong><br>Isolation distorts reality. Are the things you see real \u2014 or is your mind unraveling?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Truth</strong><br>What happened to the crew? Why is the ship drifting? And what lies hidden deep below deck?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY CONTAINER IS A RISK.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters. Every second counts.<br>Will you survive \u2014 or become part of the mystery?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist <i>30 Days Adrift</i> and prove you can outlast the sea.</p>",
